    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期有幸和“两只狗的快乐生活”做了一期串台节目！大黄和日天能量好高！有被感染到！</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于“性骚扰”这个老生常谈的话题，从Me too（2人），到We too（很多人），到With you（不要怕），再到Not surprise（普遍）都是rebel的里程碑，破除“完美受害人”的假设，当骚扰“被拆解”和“被量化”，权利游戏将失去魔法！</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰【时间切片】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 🎙️“两只狗的快乐生活”主播来啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 🎬俩节目串台搞事情，聊聊“性骚扰”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a>💡来自JAJA的三个奇葩职场性骚扰小故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> &nbsp;👨‍💼律师主播开麦：究竟什么才算骚扰呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a> 💼兔子爆料，职场的骚扰乱象！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">23:08</a> 🤔揭秘骚扰套路，骚扰成本也太低了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> 🫡《来自黄律的自我控诉》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a> ❤️男孩子也要保护好自己呀！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 🤮离谱的“被暴露”经历！建议直接报警！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2357">39:17</a> 😓吐槽广告、聚会里的骚扰“雷点”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> ☀️不要质疑自己！完美受害人是陷阱！</span></p>]]></description>
